---
import ThreeBackground from '../components/ThreeBackground';
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>Eric Cao — 构建工具，也质疑工具</title>
  <meta name="description" content="Python 工程师，开源创作者。构建工具，也质疑工具存在的理由。">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
  <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Space+Grotesk:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=Noto+Serif+SC:wght@300;400;500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }

    :root {
      --bg: #06060f;
      --surface: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03);
      --border: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.10);
      --text-primary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.95);
      --text-secondary: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.65);
      --text-muted: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.38);
      --accent: #818cf8;
      --accent-2: #22d3ee;
      --accent-3: #a78bfa;
      --accent-bright: #c7d2fe;
      --accent-dim: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.12);
      --glow-purple: rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.20);
      --glow-cyan: rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.15);
    }

    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }

    body {
      font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, sans-serif;
      background: var(--bg);
      color: var(--text-primary);
      line-height: 1.7;
      overflow-x: hidden;
      -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
    }

    .serif { font-family: 'Noto Serif SC', serif; }
    .grotesk { font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; }

    .page { position: relative; z-index: 1; min-height: 100vh; }
    .container { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem; }

    /* Aurora CSS blobs */
    .aurora-blob {
      position: fixed;
      border-radius: 50%;
      filter: blur(100px);
      pointer-events: none;
      z-index: 0;
    }
    .aurora-blob-1 {
      width: 600px; height: 500px;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(121, 40, 202, 0.18) 0%, transparent 70%);
      top: -150px; left: -150px;
      animation: drift1 14s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .aurora-blob-2 {
      width: 500px; height: 500px;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(0, 128, 255, 0.14) 0%, transparent 70%);
      top: 15%; right: -120px;
      animation: drift2 18s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    .aurora-blob-3 {
      width: 450px; height: 400px;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(34, 211, 238, 0.10) 0%, transparent 70%);
      bottom: 10%; left: 15%;
      animation: drift3 22s ease-in-out infinite alternate;
    }
    @keyframes drift1 {
      from { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
      to   { transform: translate(100px, 80px) scale(1.1); }
    }
    @keyframes drift2 {
      from { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
      to   { transform: translate(-80px, 100px) scale(0.9); }
    }
    @keyframes drift3 {
      from { transform: translate(0, 0) scale(1); }
      to   { transform: translate(70px, -80px) scale(1.05); }
    }

    /* Hero */
    .hero { min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; padding: 6rem 0 4rem; }

    .hero-name {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 9vw, 4.5rem);
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: -0.03em;
      line-height: 1.05;
      margin-bottom: 1.75rem;
      background: linear-gradient(135deg, #c7d2fe, #818cf8, #22d3ee, #a78bfa, #c7d2fe);
      background-size: 300% 300%;
      -webkit-background-clip: text;
      -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
      background-clip: text;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: aurora-shift 8s ease infinite, fadeInUp 0.9s ease forwards;
    }

    @keyframes aurora-shift {
      0%, 100% { background-position: 0% 50%; }
      50%       { background-position: 100% 50%; }
    }

    .hero-tagline {
      font-size: clamp(1rem, 3vw, 1.2rem);
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      font-weight: 300;
      line-height: 1.85;
      max-width: 560px;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeInUp 0.9s ease 0.2s forwards;
    }

    .hero-quote {
      font-size: clamp(0.95rem, 2.5vw, 1.05rem);
      color: var(--text-muted);
      font-style: italic;
      border-left: 2px solid var(--accent);
      box-shadow: -4px 0 24px var(--glow-purple);
      padding-left: 1.5rem;
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeInUp 0.9s ease 0.4s forwards;
    }

    .hero-links {
      display: flex;
      gap: 1.5rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      opacity: 0;
      animation: fadeInUp 0.9s ease 0.6s forwards;
    }

    .hero-link {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.9rem;
      transition: color 0.25s ease, text-shadow 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .hero-link:hover {
      color: var(--accent-2);
      text-shadow: 0 0 20px var(--glow-cyan);
    }

    @keyframes fadeInUp {
      from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(22px); }
      to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
    }

    /* Section */
    .section { padding: 6rem 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .section-title {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 0.7rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      letter-spacing: 0.2em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-bottom: 3rem;
    }

    /* Projects */
    .projects-list { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0; }

    .project {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 1.25rem;
      padding: 2.25rem 0 2.25rem 1.5rem;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-left: 2px solid transparent;
      transition: border-left-color 0.3s ease, padding-left 0.3s ease;
    }
    .project:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .project:hover { border-left-color: var(--accent); }

    .project-header {
      display: flex;
      align-items: baseline;
      justify-content: space-between;
      gap: 1rem;
    }

    .project-name {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-size: 1.15rem;
      font-weight: 500;
      color: var(--text-primary);
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: color 0.25s ease;
      cursor: pointer;
    }
    .project-name:hover { color: var(--accent-bright); }

    .project-stars {
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', monospace;
      font-size: 0.82rem;
      color: var(--accent-2);
      white-space: nowrap;
    }

    .project-desc {
      font-size: 0.95rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 1.75;
    }

    .project-tags { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .tag {
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      padding: 0.2rem 0.65rem;
      border-radius: 4px;
      background: var(--accent-dim);
      border: 1px solid rgba(129, 140, 248, 0.2);
      color: var(--accent-bright);
      font-weight: 500;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
    }

    /* Thoughts */
    .thought { padding: 2.5rem 0 2.5rem 1.5rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); border-left: 2px solid transparent; transition: border-left-color 0.3s ease; }
    .thought:last-child { border-bottom: none; }
    .thought:hover { border-left-color: var(--accent-3); }

    .thought-text {
      font-size: 1rem;
      color: var(--text-secondary);
      line-height: 2;
      font-weight: 300;
    }

    .thought-meta {
      font-size: 0.78rem;
      color: var(--accent);
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
      font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif;
      font-weight: 500;
      letter-spacing: 0.05em;
    }

    /* Footer */
    .footer { padding: 4rem 0 3rem; border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 4rem; }
    .footer-content { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 1.5rem; }
    .footer-copy { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-family: 'Space Grotesk', sans-serif; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 2rem; }
    .footer-link { font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); text-decoration: none; transition: color 0.25s ease; }
    .footer-link:hover { color: var(--accent-bright); }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .container { padding: 0 1.25rem; }
      .hero { padding: 4rem 0 3rem; }
      .section { padding: 4rem 0; }
      .project { padding-left: 1rem; }
      .thought { padding-left: 1rem; }
      .project-header { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
      .footer-content { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
    }

    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after {
        animation-duration: 0.01ms !important;
        animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
        transition-duration: 0.01ms !important;
      }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <ThreeBackground client:load />
  <div class="aurora-blob aurora-blob-1"></div>
  <div class="aurora-blob aurora-blob-2"></div>
  <div class="aurora-blob aurora-blob-3"></div>

  <div class="page">
    <div class="container">
      <section class="hero">
        <h1 class="hero-name">Eric Cao</h1>
        <p class="hero-tagline">
          用 AI 写代码，用剩下的时间质疑自己写的代码。<br>
          目前这是一个还挺有效率的循环。
        </p>
        <blockquote class="hero-quote serif">
          "快是 AI 的事。值不值得快，还是你的事。"
        </blockquote>
        <div class="hero-links">
          <a href="https://github.com/caoergou" class="hero-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor"><path d="M12 2C6.477 2 2 6.484 2 12.017c0 4.425 2.865 8.18 6.839 9.504.5.092.682-.217.682-.483 0-.237-.008-.868-.013-1.703-2.782.605-3.369-1.343-3.369-1.343-.454-1.158-1.11-1.466-1.11-1.466-.908-.62.069-.608.069-.608 1.003.07 1.531 1.032 1.531 1.032.892 1.53 2.341 1.088 2.91.832.092-.647.35-1.088.636-1.338-2.22-.253-4.555-1.113-4.555-4.951 0-1.093.39-1.988 1.029-2.688-.103-.253-.446-1.272.098-2.65 0 0 .84-.27 2.75 1.026A9.564 9.564 0 0112 6.844c.85.004 1.705.115 2.504.337 1.909-1.296 2.747-1.027 2.747-1.027.546 1.379.202 2.398.1 2.651.64.7 1.028 1.595 1.028 2.688 0 3.848-2.339 4.695-4.566 4.943.359.309.678.92.678 1.855 0 1.338-.012 2.419-.012 2.747 0 .268.18.58.688.482A10.019 10.019 0 0022 12.017C22 6.484 17.522 2 12 2z"/></svg>
            GitHub
          </a>
          <a href="https://jike.city/ergou" class="hero-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M21 15a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H7l-4 4V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2h14a2 2 0 0 1 2 2z"/></svg>
            即刻
          </a>
          <a href="mailto:itsericsmail@gmail.com" class="hero-link">
            <svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path d="M4 4h16c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2v12c0 1.1-.9 2-2 2H4c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V6c0-1.1.9-2 2-2z"/><polyline points="22,6 12,13 2,6"/></svg>
            邮件
          </a>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">作品</h2>
        <div class="projects-list">
          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-header">
              <a href="https://github.com/caoergou/airflow-extended-api-plugin" class="project-name" target="_blank" rel="noopener">airflow-extended-api-plugin</a>
              <span class="project-stars">★ 78</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-desc">为 Apache Airflow 扩展 RESTful API。当官方接口无法满足复杂工作流编排时，这个插件通过 CLI 命令提供了更灵活的集成路径——不是绕过官方设计，而是在它的边界之外补全缺失的部分。</p>
            <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">Airflow</span><span class="tag">生产级</span></div>
          </article>

          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-header">
              <a href="https://github.com/caoergou/cnpip" class="project-name" target="_blank" rel="noopener">cnpip</a>
              <span class="project-stars">★ 43</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-desc">解决中国开发者的真实痛点：pip 太慢。自动测速，选最快镜像，一条命令切换。这个工具的全部价值在于它的可预测性——你知道它做什么，也知道它不做什么。</p>
            <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">CLI</span><span class="tag">开发工具</span></div>
          </article>

          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-header">
              <a href="http://eric.run.place/mermaid-pic/" class="project-name" target="_blank" rel="noopener">mermaid-pic</a>
              <span class="project-stars">在线工具</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-desc">在线 Mermaid 图表编辑器。零依赖，纯前端，打开 HTML 文件即用——没有构建步骤，没有 node_modules，没有版本冲突。这是一个刻意的选择，不是技术局限。</p>
            <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">JavaScript</span><span class="tag">零依赖</span><span class="tag">可视化</span></div>
          </article>

          <article class="project">
            <div class="project-header">
              <a href="https://github.com/caoergou/COVID-19Simulation" class="project-name" target="_blank" rel="noopener">COVID-19 Simulation</a>
              <span class="project-stars">★ 12</span>
            </div>
            <p class="project-desc">用 Python turtle 模拟疫情传播动态。代码 200 行以内，逻辑清晰，面向入门者。有时候，让人看懂比让机器跑快更难——这是教育价值高于技术复杂度的一次实践。</p>
            <div class="project-tags"><span class="tag">Python</span><span class="tag">教育</span></div>
          </article>
        </div>
      </section>

      <section class="section">
        <h2 class="section-title">思考</h2>

        <article class="thought">
          <p class="thought-text serif">有一天我用 AI 两小时写完了一个功能，坐在椅子上发呆了很久。<br><br>不是因为激动——而是因为不知道接下来做什么了。以前「构建」本身会占据大量时间，这个过程里，你会把问题想得更清楚。速度剥夺了这段时间。<br><br>现在我刻意保留发呆的时间。用 AI 提速，用多出来的部分想：这个东西应该存在吗？有没有根本不需要代码的方案？这些问题很慢，AI 帮不上忙。但它们正在变成差异所在。</p>
          <p class="thought-meta">— 关于速度剥夺的东西</p>
        </article>

        <article class="thought">
          <p class="thought-text serif">airflow-extended-api-plugin 有 78 个 star。这个数字有时让我犯难——不知道是 78 个人在用它，还是 78 个人觉得「看起来有用」然后关掉了标签页。<br><br>有几个 issue 我会一直记得。有人在生产环境里把它用在了我完全没设计的场景，然后礼貌地问「这样用可以吗」。<br><br>可以的。比我想的更好。<br><br>这让我意识到：你写的代码，只是别人创造的起点。开源最有意思的部分，是你根本控制不了它会去哪里。</p>
          <p class="thought-meta">— 关于工具的第二生命</p>
        </article>

        <article class="thought">
          <p class="thought-text serif">mermaid-pic 的技术决策：不用任何构建工具，打开 HTML 就能用。<br><br>这个决定在 2022 年看起来像偷懒。在 AI 能帮你二十分钟搭起带完整 CI/CD 项目的今天，问题本身变了。<br><br>不再是「能不能做」，而是「为什么要做」。<br><br>不是每个工具都需要 TypeScript 和完整测试套件。有时候一个 HTML 文件就够了。知道什么时候「够了」，比知道怎么做更难。AI 会帮你执行任何决定，但不会替你知道哪个决定是对的。</p>
          <p class="thought-meta">— 关于丰盛时代里的克制</p>
        </article>
      </section>

      <footer class="footer">
        <div class="footer-content">
          <span class="footer-copy">© 2026 Eric Cao</span>
          <div class="footer-links">
            <a href="https://github.com/caoergou" class="footer-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">GitHub</a>
            <a href="https://jike.city/ergou" class="footer-link" target="_blank" rel="noopener">即刻</a>
            <a href="mailto:itsericsmail@gmail.com" class="footer-link">Email</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </footer>
    </div>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
